# The Update app (desktop user) runs Handtop's update worker without a password, with fixed
# operations only (project doc update-system.md). "schedule" may name the plan the app showed
# (12 hex digits, a sudo regular expression; sudo >= 1.9.10).
%sudo ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/sbin/handtop-update status, /usr/local/sbin/handtop-update check, /usr/local/sbin/handtop-update download, /usr/local/sbin/handtop-update schedule, /usr/local/sbin/handtop-update schedule restart, /usr/local/sbin/handtop-update schedule poweroff, /usr/local/sbin/handtop-update ^schedule (restart|poweroff) [0-9a-f]{12}$, /usr/local/sbin/handtop-update cancel, /usr/local/sbin/handtop-update channel stable, /usr/local/sbin/handtop-update channel testing
